    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="2cde6eeb-7353-57b3-8722-28e122c4705d" activityNameId="af224df9-fd71-5d65-bbd9-e652b5928633" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, PV, at 570 kWp open ground, multi-Si</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, PV, at 570 kWp open ground, multi-Si
Electricity from a photovoltaic installation with a capacity of 570 kWp and a life time of 30 years installed in 2008 in ES and operated by Edisun Power Iberia S.A. Module efficiency updated based on Fraunhofer ISE Photovoltaics Report from 14 November 2019. Specific annual yield adjusted based on Breyer &amp; Schmid (2010) (calculated with population-density weighted solar irradiation of fixed tilted PV systems). UUID: 6c48a312-fefb-3fc1-8982-6f336186b558
Infrastructure for 570kWp PV plant, water use for cleaning, amount of solar energy transformed to electricity and waste heat emission due to losses of electricity in the system. Annual output, Centralised: 1509 kWh/kWp.
Location: Use in ES.
Technology: Electricity production with grid-connected photovoltaic power plants.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistical data for ES.
Extrapolations: Water demand estimated at 20 L per m2 PV module over life time of the system.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6c48a312-fefb-3fc1-8982-6f336186b558.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
